# text = I was never so beaten with anything in my life : but you must e'en take it as a gift of God ; though it's as dark almost as if it came from the devil You must exchange horses with me : I don't like mine ; and if you won't I shall tell your father of the three thrashings you've given me this week , and show him my arm , which is black to the shoulder You'd better do it at once you will have to : and if I speak of these blows , you'll get them again with interest Off , dog Throw it and then I'll tell how you boasted that you would turn me out of doors as soon as he died , and see whether he will not turn you out directly Take my colt , Gipsy , then And I pray that he may break your neck : take him , and he damned , you beggarly interloper ! and wheedle my father out of all he has : only afterwards show him what you are , imp of Satan . -
