# text = Though Mr . Hareton , there , be not the master's son , he's your cousin : and I was never hired to serve you HE my cousin Yes , indeed Oh , Ellen ! don't let them say such things Hush , hush people can have many cousins and of all sorts , Miss Cathy , without being any the worse for it ; only they needn't keep their company , if they be disagreeable and bad He's not - he's not my cousin , Ellen offald ways love darling queen angel Linton is just six months younger than I am How delightful it will be to have him for a playfellow !
